# Shell scripts outside out/ keep LF line endings (they run under WSL/Linux)
*.sh text eol=lf

# Archives are binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# Everything under out/ is evidence: submitted sources whose bytes equal the ZIP entries (v6 was submitted with CRLF line endings),
# generated data files, path_map.tsv, replays. Store the exact bytes; never normalise line endings.
out/** -text
